entries[396169] = { ["name"] = "Elementally Charged Stone", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n5.3 sec cast\nAttentive and curious miners may sometimes discover geological samples that had been infused with multiple elements. Even these remnant energies are determined to not relinquish their grasp on the materials they have latched onto.\n\nWhile it would be unwise to disturb it, there may be something to learn by studying the magical binding.\nProfession:\nMining (1)" }
