entries[396171] = { ["name"] = "Infused Pollen", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n5.3 sec cast\nAs the elemental energies of the Dragon Isles awaken, they tether themselves to materials of all sorts. Diligent herbalists may find samples of pollen that have been bound with these energies.\n\nWhile it could be dangerous to disturb it, you can gain knowledge by studying such a rare phenomenon.\nProfession:\nDragon Isles Herbalism (1)" }
